***acceptance tests***

# missing-link
The file `missing_link.plain` whose scenario `works` links `missing.md`, which does not exist, raises `PlainSyntaxError` whose message starts with `Plain syntax error: Link missing.md in test plain file 'missing_link.plain', scenario `works` does not exist. Linked resources are looked up relative to the following directories`.

# link-to-plain-file
The file `link_to_plain_file.plain` whose scenario links `valid.plain` raises `PlainSyntaxError` holding `Referenced resource 'valid.plain' in test plain file`.
